message: "If you use GFSM v1, please cite the published Scientific Data paper and the Zenodo dataset release."
title: "Global Flood Susceptibility Map (GFSM v1): A high resolution (30m) flood susceptibility dataset derived from multi-source Earth observation and geospatial data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Waleed
    given-names: Mirza
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0006-2490"
