url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20568218"
repository-code: "https://github.com/waleedgeo/GFSM"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  GFSM v1 is a globally harmonized 30 m flood susceptibility dataset derived
  from multi-source Earth observation and geospatial data using a machine
  learning framework. The released EI-5 product provides five susceptibility
  classes across near-global land areas.
keywords:
  - flood susceptibility
  - Earth observation
  - geospatial data
  - machine learning
  - global dataset
